            "arabic_text": "عَنْهُ عَنْ أَبِيهِ عَنْ مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ حَفْصٍ عَنْ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ بْنِ طَلْحَةَ قَالَ",
            "chunk_type": "isnad",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "From him, from his father, from Muḥammad ibn Ḥafṣ, from ʿAbd Allāh ibn Ṭalḥah, who said:",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 13,
            "word_start": 0
          },
          {
            "arabic_text": "سَأَلْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ اللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ عَنِ الرَّجُلِ يَبِيعُ الرَّجُلَ وَهُمَا حُرَّانِ يَبِيعُ هَذَا هَذَا وَهَذَا هَذَا وَيَفِرَّانِ مِنْ بَلَدٍ إِلَى بَلَدٍ فَيَبِيعَانِ أَنْفُسَهُمَا وَيَفِرَّانِ بِأَمْوَالِ النَّاسِ",
            "chunk_type": "opening",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "I asked Abā ʿAbd Allāh عليه السلام about a man selling another man while both of them are free: this one sells that one, and that one sells this one, and they flee from one town to another, then sell themselves and abscond with the people's wealth.",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 40,
            "word_start": 13
          },
          {
            "arabic_text": "قَالَ: «تُقْطَعُ أَيْدِيهِمَا لِأَنَّهُمَا سَرَقَا أَنْفُسَهُمَا وَأَمْوَالَ الْمُسْلِمِينَ».",
            "chunk_type": "body",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "He عليه السلام said: “Their hands are to be cut off, because they stole themselves and the wealth of the Muslims.”",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
